      "cat-harness:section": "There is no no-JavaScript floor here — and exactly two gates that look like one",
      "prov:value": "The first is the **board's** linear floor and nothing wider: it is R4 of [`folio-board-requirements`](../../../docs/concepts/architecture/folio-board-requirements.md), whose subject is the board.",
