      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "issue",
      "cat-harness:section": "There is no no-JavaScript floor here — and exactly two gates that look like one",
      "prov:value": "`mountNavIconRow`, `mountDocumentIndex` and `mountInstanceGraphs` build three of its regions in the DOM at load — shipped in #959, documented in `test/navbar-row.e2e.ts` as \"the three JS-mounted navbar regions\", and no gate in this repository objects.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#959"
      ]
